    "body": "One suggestion: Consider removing the Helm 2 comment. Helm 2 was EOL in November 2020 (https://helm.sh/blog/helm-2-becomes-unsupported/), and without the `--client` flag, `helm version --short` attempts to connect to Tiller - if that connection fails, the command returns a non-zero exit code and `exec_cmd` returns `None`, so the parsing code is never reached anyway.\n\nI agree that starship doesn't need to support Helm 2 at this point.",
